/* Colour is split out and withheld from the metal material, which owns its own
   per-mode row colour (nse-sourcelist.css). Both rules are (0,2,0) — the
   `:where()` in the metal selector contributes nothing — and this file loads
   later, so a plain tie handed every metal row #333. On the dark rail that left
   the primary line readable (the sidebar restates it at (0,4,0)) while the
   TRAILING badge, which has no restatement, went near-black on steel. Geometry
   stays universal above; only the colour is handed back. */
:scope[data-nse-theme="com.syndromatic.atmo"] .nse-control-list-item:not([data-nse-material="metal"] *) {
